            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No power data yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "线缆可能限制了协商档位（未标 5A 的线无法请求大电流档）；电池状态也可能影响，仅供参考" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The cable may be limiting the negotiated tier (a cable not rated 5A can't request a high-current tier); battery condition may also be a factor — for reference only"
